#. 押してもダメだし、叩いてもダメだし…
#. どうなってんの？
msgctxt "0001 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Pushing on 'em doesn't help, smacking 'em doesn't\n"
"help... What the heck is up with those things?"
msgstr ""

#. …あ、窓の鉄板の話ね！
msgctxt "0002 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Oh! Sorry, I'm talking about the metal plates covering\n"
"all the windows."
msgstr ""

#. …そうだ！
#. 引いてみたら、どうなんだろ！？
msgctxt "0003 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Ah, I know! We should try grabbing the top and yanking\n"
"down on it!"
msgstr ""

#. 一緒に過ごす
msgctxt "0004 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Spend some time with Hina"
msgstr ""

#. 他の場所へ行く
msgctxt "0005 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Go see who else is around"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どうしよう？
#. 朝日奈さんを誘ってみようか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hmm... Should I talk to Hina for a while?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. お、私と一緒にストレッチでもする！？
msgctxt "0007 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "You wanna do some stretches with me?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんと一緒に、
#. 入念なストレッチを繰り返した。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I followed Hina's lead and did some elaborate\n"
"stretching...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんと少し仲良くなれたみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hina and I grew a little closer today.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 渡す
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes, definitely"
msgstr ""

#. 渡さない
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Not really, no"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>プレゼント<CLT><CLT 23>を渡しますか？<CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | NARRATION"
msgid "<CLT 3><CLT><CLT 23>Would you like to give Hina a<CLT> <CLT 3>present<CLT><CLT 23>?<CLT>"
msgstr ""
